OL,3,GNEWSAChumbawamba star writes new
OL,4,A'Anthem for Burnley'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA musician behind one of the biggest
OL,7,FBritish hits of the 1990s has written a
OL,8,Fnew anthem for Burnley's Year of
OL,9,FCulture 2027 celebrations.
OL,11,FBoff Whalley, a founding member of
OL,12,FBurnley-based Chumbawamba, wrote and
OL,13,Fproduced Ours to Make with the aim of
OL,14,Fcapturing the spirit of the Lancashire
OL,15,Ftown.
OL,17,FPeople in the town will get their first
OL,18,Fchance to hear the track when it is
OL,19,Fperformed live during the Burnley
OL,20,FBelieves stage show on St James's
OL,21,FStreet on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
