OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnley's Year of Culture aims to
OL,7,Fcelebrate the borough's creativity,
OL,8,Fheritage and communities through a
OL,9,Fprogramme of events designed to boost
OL,10,Fcivic pride, support local artists and
OL,11,Fattract visitors and investment.
